    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >HOSTILE DREAMS WILL PUSH YOU TO YOUR LIMITS</h2><br><strong>A dark and psychedelic atmosphere pervades this precision platformer, which presents a tough challenge with its unique ragdoll-based controls.</strong><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2311790/extras/436988a1ff3412453fe44b5c6c800b4b.poster.avif?t=1737238615\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2311790/extras/436988a1ff3412453fe44b5c6c800b4b.webm?t=1737238615\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2311790/extras/436988a1ff3412453fe44b5c6c800b4b.mp4?t=1737238615\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2311790/extras/9bb67c6f1cd55c24ebdb947d400acc1d.poster.avif?t=1737238615\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2311790/extras/9bb67c6f1cd55c24ebdb947d400acc1d.webm?t=1737238615\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2311790/extras/9bb67c6f1cd55c24ebdb947d400acc1d.mp4?t=1737238615\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2311790/extras/d73875f87c1a7c8239caf1b058c4ff28.poster.avif?t=1737238615\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2311790/extras/d73875f87c1a7c8239caf1b058c4ff28.webm?t=1737238615\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2311790/extras/d73875f87c1a7c8239caf1b058c4ff28.mp4?t=1737238615\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br><strong><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Escape from this dark dream to reach the end of your story.<br></li><li>18 challenging levels are waiting for you to complete them.<br></li><li>Master the levels and dodge deadly traps and enemies! <br></li><li>By collecting dream shards, you can unlock additional bonus levels if the basic levels are too easy for you!</li></ul></strong><br><strong>But be careful, no one will wake you up!</strong>",
    "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >HOSTILE DREAMS WILL PUSH YOU TO YOUR LIMITS</h2><br><strong>A dark and psychedelic atmosphere pervades this precision platformer, which presents a tough challenge with its unique ragdoll-based controls.</strong><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2311790/extras/436988a1ff3412453fe44b5c6c800b4b.poster.avif?t=1737238615\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2311790/extras/436988a1ff3412453fe44b5c6c800b4b.webm?t=1737238615\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2311790/extras/436988a1ff3412453fe44b5c6c800b4b.mp4?t=1737238615\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2311790/extras/9bb67c6f1cd55c24ebdb947d400acc1d.poster.avif?t=1737238615\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2311790/extras/9bb67c6f1cd55c24ebdb947d400acc1d.webm?t=1737238615\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2311790/extras/9bb67c6f1cd55c24ebdb947d400acc1d.mp4?t=1737238615\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2311790/extras/d73875f87c1a7c8239caf1b058c4ff28.poster.avif?t=1737238615\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2311790/extras/d73875f87c1a7c8239caf1b058c4ff28.webm?t=1737238615\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2311790/extras/d73875f87c1a7c8239caf1b058c4ff28.mp4?t=1737238615\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br><strong><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Escape from this dark dream to reach the end of your story.<br></li><li>18 challenging levels are waiting for you to complete them.<br></li><li>Master the levels and dodge deadly traps and enemies! <br></li><li>By collecting dream shards, you can unlock additional bonus levels if the basic levels are too easy for you!</li></ul></strong><br><strong>But be careful, no one will wake you up!</strong>",
